## Preserve data quality condition properties

Context: Selecting a property in a data quality rule condition triggered a
rerender through options captured before the target entity was selected. The
selected value disappeared and the condition property list became empty.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-conditions.js
   Keep delegated condition-row handlers synchronized with the latest render options.
2. tests/units/front/test_dq_condition_builder.py
   Add a Node-based regression test covering an initially empty property list followed by a populated render.

